[This] eye[ color] look[ is] pure decad[ence] and drama[,] and calls for little more than a[ steady] hand and a great eye shadow palette. ([Oh,] and loads of[ mascara] or some lush falsies.) Try[ this look] with a flirty holiday[ dress] and you’ll[ look] as[ fashionable on] the[ outside] as you feel[ on] the inside.
